      "text": "SUMMARY\nMaria Ioannou is a principal Head of Product based in Nicosia, Cyprus, with 14 years of total experience. Her\nexpertise encompasses product strategy, roadmapping, agile methodologies, team leadership, data analytics,\nand user research. She has held leadership roles across technology, software, and information technology\nindustries."
    },
