    {
      "id": "maria-ioannou:experience:1",
      "section": "experience",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "EXPERIENCE\nHead of Product — Troodos Tech 03/2021 – Present\nIndustry: Technology\n– Led product strategy and roadmapping initiatives as Head of Product.\n– Exercised team leadership using agile methodologies within the technology industry.\nSenior Product Manager — Levant Software 02/2016 – 02/2021\nIndustry: Software\n– Managed roadmapping and user research projects as a senior product manager.\n– Applied data analytics and agile methodologies in the software industry.\nProduct Manager — Kyrenia Systems 09/2012 – 01/2016\nIndustry: Information Technology\n– Contributed to product strategy and user research as a product manager.\n– Utilized data analytics within the information technology industry."
